<title>CANADA: TABLE - Bank of Canada monetary index to July 23.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Bank of Canada monetary index to July 23.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada released its monetary conditions index:</p>
<p>		    3-month paper	Cdn dollar	Index</p>
<p>July 23		3.58		 83.79	 -5.48</p>
<p>July 16		3.52		 84.22	 -5.37</p>
<p>July 9		 3.42		 83.97	 -5.57</p>
<p>July 2		 3.50		 83.78	 -5.57</p>
<p>June 25		3.27		 82.62	 -6.26</p>
<p>June 18		3.19		 83.13	 -6.13</p>
<p>June 11		3.24		 82.99	 -6.14</p>
<p>June 4		 3.25		 83.96	 -5.74</p>
<p>May 28		 3.27		 83.31	 -5.98</p>
<p>May 21		 3.27		 84.20	 -5.63</p>
<p>May 14		 3.35		 83.35	 -5.89</p>
<p>May 7		  3.36		 83.97	 -5.63</p>
<p>April 30	     3.44		 83.19	 -5.86</p>
<p>April 23	     3.41		 83.27	 -5.86</p>
<p>April 16	     3.49		 83.07	 -5.86</p>
<p>April 9		3.47		 83.72	 -5.62</p>
<p>NOTE - The index measures the 3-month prime corporate paper rate and the Canadian dollar index against G-10 currencies. Index base is January 1987.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745))</p>
